[b]Are you nerd enough to SURVIVE?[/b]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37599271/10e418b24a794f19ae30f76df64a0ab32bc12f8d.png[/img]

[b]Survival of the Nerdiest[/b], the first premium DLC for Doom & Destiny Worlds, is a brand new game mode for the original game that introduces [i]new game mechanics[/i] for a completely [i]new gaming experience![/i]

https://store.steampowered.com/app/1519170/Doom__Destiny_Worlds__Survival_of_the_Nerdiest/?curator_clanid=37599271

Start a NEW GAME and face [i]hunger, thirst, sleep, hot and cold weather[/i]. You need to gather food and water if you don't want to become food yourself for the many creatures that dwells on the worlds of Halargian!

[h2]Survival of the Nerdiest features:[/h2][list]
[*]Hunger and Thirst mechanic: find food and water to avoid starvation and dehydration;
[*]Unique cooking recipes: some special "feast" will grants the whole party powerful bonuses in battle!
[*]Sleep mechanics: you need to rest or your party will be tired and weak. Resting comfortable will grand you bonus;
[*]Hot and Cold mechanic: if not dressed properly, the islands temperature will affects your stats. Wear appropriate gear to face the weather;
[*]NEW MONSTER dwells the three worlds of Halargian. Hunt them down to gather unique resources;
[*]BREED animals to have constant supply of food or company.[/list]
